  "system": {
    "slug": "cerberus-dragoon",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 6
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Cerberus Dragoons are biotic-augmented soldiers who wield powerful mass-effect lashes to grab and smash enemies or rip through multiple targets. They close range aggressively, using their biotic lash to pull enemies out of cover before finishing them in melee. Their biotic barrier regenerates quickly.</p><p><strong>Biotic Lash (2 actions):</strong> The Dragoon extends a lash of dark energy up to 20 feet. Each creature in a 20-foot line must succeed on a DC 23 Reflex save or take 3d8 bludgeoning damage and be Grabbed (pulled adjacent to Dragoon). On a success, half damage and not Grabbed. On a critical failure, also Stunned 1.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn. Powered by biotic energy.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true
      },
